<body>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0"><img src="../_svg/composite_shape.svg" alt="" style="max-width:95%;height:auto;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)"></div>
<div class="lf-page"><div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">LF Academy · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 42 堂 · Student Edition Handout</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">Area概念＋SquareRectangleArea</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">Area的意義 · SquareArea公式 · RectangleArea公式 · 65 min · 1-on-3 Online Lesson</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info"><b>Textbook Reference：</b>《小學數學新思維（第二版）》3下B冊<br/>
<b>SSPA 關聯：</b><span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考</span> Area係呈分試幾何題核心，P4-P6 所有幾何嘅基礎<br/>
<b>Prerequisites：</b>L41 Perimeter概念 · Multiplication表 · 長度單位<br/>
<b>Lesson Objectives：</b>❶ 理解Area概念 ❷ SquareArea公式 ❸ RectangleArea公式 ❹ 分辨Perimeter和Area<br/>
<b>核心Trap：</b>🪤 T13 Area vs Perimeter混淆 · T14 Area單位漏寫「平方」· T15 Rectangle長闊掉轉</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row"><span>Student Name：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Class：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Date：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>Duration：<span class="lf-line"></span></span></div>
</div><div><div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up （5 min）（共 5 題，5 min）</div>
<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>邊個Area大啲：書枱定書本？你點知？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>一張枱有 6 個 1cm² 嘅方格，枱Area係？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>Square邊長 3cm，入面可以放幾多個 1cm² 嘅小方格？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>Perimeter用 cm，Area用咩單位？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>Rectangle長 5cm、闊 4cm，Area係咪 5×4 = 20？單位係咩？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge （15 min） ＋ Worked Examples</div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Area概念 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① <b>Area（Area）</b>= 平面圖形表面的大小<br/>② 單位：<b>平方厘米（cm²）</b>、<b>平方米（m²）</b><br/>③ 1cm² = 邊長 1cm 嘅Square嘅Area<br/>④ Area係「入面有幾多格」，Perimeter係「圍一圈有幾長」<br/>⑤ Mnemonic：「Area睇入面，Perimeter睇外圍，兩樣嘢唔好撈亂！」</div></div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：SquareArea公式 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① SquareArea = <b>邊長 × 邊長</b><br/>② 公式：<b>A = 邊長 × 邊長</b><br/>③ 例：邊長 4cm → Area = 4×4 = 16cm²（讀：16 平方厘米）<br/>④ 逆向：邊長 = √Area（背 1-12 嘅平方數！）<br/>⑤ Mnemonic：「SquareArea點計？邊長乘邊長最易記！」</div></div><div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：RectangleArea公式 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div><div class="lf-kp-rules">① RectangleArea = <b>長 × 闊</b><br/>② 公式：<b>A = 長 × 闊</b><br/>③ 例：長 6cm、闊 3cm → Area = 6×3 = 18cm²<br/>④ 長同闊嘅位置可以掉轉（Multiplication交換律），答案一樣<br/>⑤ Mnemonic：「<div style="text-align:center;margin:10px 0;"><svg style="max-width:280px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px auto;" viewbox="0 0 280 145" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="75" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="200" x="20" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="220" y1="35" y2="35"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="20" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="220" x2="220" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="120.0" y="49">8 cm</text>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="238" x2="238" y1="20" y2="95"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="233" x2="243" y1="20" y2="20"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="233" x2="243" y1="95" y2="95"></line>
</svg></div>
RectangleArea唔難計，長乘闊就係個Area！」</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一塊Square地磚邊長 30cm，Area係幾多？</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例2</div><div class="lf-ex-q">Rectangle書枱長 120cm、闊 60cm，Area係幾多？</div></div><div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">SquareArea 64cm²，邊長係幾多？提示：幾多乘幾多 = 64？</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>邊長 5cm Square<br/>Area = 5×4 = 20？<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b>5×4 係Perimeter！<br/>Area係邊長×邊長！</div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Square邊長 5cm<br/>Area = 5×5 = 25<b>cm²</b> ✓<br/>Area單位要有「平方」！</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>Rectangle長 8cm、闊 3cm<br/>Area = 8+3 = 11cm²？<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b>Area係乘唔係加！</div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Rectangle長 8cm、闊 3cm<br/>Area = 8×3 = 24cm² ✓<br/>長乘闊！加係Perimeter嘅做法！</div></div><div class="lf-ex-compare"><div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Trap引爆</div>Area = 12cm² 的Square<br/>邊長 = 12÷4 = 3cm？<br/><b>❌ 錯！</b>Area逆向唔係除 4！</div><div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ Correct Approach</div>Area = 12cm² 的Square<br/>3×3=9 · 4×4=16<br/>12 唔係SquareArea！<br/>要背平方數：1,4,9,16,25…</div></div><div class="warn">⚠️ Area同Perimeter係兩個完全唔同嘅概念！Perimeter用 cm，Area用 cm²。考試最鍾意叫你比較兩個！</div><div class="warn">⚠️ Area單位一定要寫「平方厘米（cm²）」或「平方米（m²）」。唔寫單位成題冇分！</div><div class="warn">⚠️ RectangleArea = 長×闊，唔好同Perimeter公式 (長+闊)×2 撈亂。一個係乘，一個係加完再乘。</div></div><div><div class="lf-h1">三、Tiered Practice （20 min）</div><div class="lf-h2">🌱 Foundation Tier（共 6 題） Foundation Tier（All Must Complete）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>Rectangle長 7cm、闊 2cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>Square邊長 5cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>Rectangle長 9cm、闊 4cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>Square邊長 6cm，Area = ？Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>一塊Rectangle地墊長 2m、闊 1m，Area = ？用咩單位？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>Square邊長 10cm，Area = ？Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🌿 Intermediate Tier（共 5 題） Intermediate Tier（🚶🚀 Optional）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>RectangleArea 40cm²，長 8cm，闊 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>SquareArea 49cm²，邊長 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>一個Rectangle長 12cm、闊係長嘅一半。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>課室長 9m、闊 7m。Area係？如果每平方米坐 2 人，可以坐幾多人？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>一個Square同一個RectangleArea一樣。Square邊長 8cm，Rectangle長 16cm，闊 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🌳 Challenge Tier（共 5 題） Challenge Tier（🚀 Optional）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>RectangleArea 96cm²，長 12cm。Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">18</td><td>一塊Rectangle木板長 8dm、闊 5dm。Area係幾多 cm²？（提示：1dm = 10cm）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">19</td><td>Square邊長增加 2cm，Area增加 24cm²。原Square邊長係？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">20</td><td>一個RectanglePerimeter 48cm、長 15cm。Area = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">21</td><td>用 24 個 1cm² 嘅小Square拼成Rectangle，有幾多種拼法？邊種Perimeter最長？邊種最短？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">🏔️ Extreme Tier（共 2 題） </div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">22</td><td>RectanglePerimeter 40cm，Area最大可以係幾多？提示：長闊越接近，Area越大。試列所有可能性。</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">23</td><td>用一條 36cm 嘅鐵絲圍一個Rectangle（包括Square），最大Area係幾多？你發現咩規律？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">四、Word Problems （12 min）（SSPA 文字題，共 {len(word_probs)} 題）</div>{qt_table(word_probs)}</div><div><div class="lf-h1">五、Homework （課後完成）</div><div class="lf-h2">Foundation (Required)（共 9 題）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H1</td><td>Rectangle長 5cm、闊 3cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H2</td><td>Square邊長 7cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H3</td><td>Rectangle長 10cm、闊 6cm，Area = ？Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H4</td><td>Square邊長 11cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H5</td><td>RectangleArea 72cm²，闊 6cm，長 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H6</td><td>SquareArea 81cm²，邊長 = ？Perimeter = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H7</td><td>房間長 6m、闊 4m。每平方米舖地板要 $120，舖滿要幾錢？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H8</td><td>RectanglePerimeter 36cm、長 12cm，Area = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H9</td><td>一個Rectangle長增加 3cm、闊不變，Area增加 24cm²。原Rectangle闊係幾多？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table><div class="lf-h2">Advanced (Optional)（共 5 題 🚀）</div><table class="lf-qt"><tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H10</td><td>Square邊長增加 20%，Area增加百份之幾？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H11</td><td>蚊帳長 2m、闊 1.5m、高 1.2m。床的Area係？蚊帳幾面係Rectangle？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H12</td><td>兩個RectangleArea一樣。甲長 16cm、闊 4cm；乙長 8cm，闊 = ？乙嘅Perimeter比甲大定細？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H13</td><td>一塊鐵皮長 30cm、闊 20cm。四個角各剪去一個 5×5 嘅Square，剩餘Area係？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr><tr><td class="lf-qn">H14</td><td>Rectangle嘅長同闊都係整數，Area = 48cm²。Perimeter最長同最短分別係幾多？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr></table></div><div><div class="lf-h1">六、Common Error Summary （8 min）</div><div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ Self Check（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅Trap</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住Mnemonic</span>
</div></div>
<table class="et"><tr><th>#</th><th>Common Error（❌ Trap）</th><th>Correct Approach（✅）</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td><b>Area vs Perimeter混淆</b></td><td>Area = 長×闊（cm²），Perimeter = (長+闊)×2（cm）。Area係入面，Perimeter係外圍。</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td><b>Area單位漏寫「平方」</b></td><td>Area單位一定要寫 cm² 或 m²。寫 cm 就係錯！因為 cm 係長度單位，唔係Area單位。</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td><b>逆向題用錯方法</b></td><td>俾Area求邊長：Square邊長 = √Area（背平方數）。唔係Area÷4！</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td><b>SquareArea用錯公式</b></td><td>SquareArea = 邊長×邊長。唔好用邊長×4（×4 係Perimeter！）</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td><b>長和闊調轉冇影響</b></td><td>Multiplication交換律：長×闊 = 闊×長。Area一樣。</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td><b>單位換算唔小心</b></td><td>1m = 100cm，所以 1m² = 100cm×100cm = 10000cm²！唔好以為 1m²=100cm²！</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td><b>只計長×闊但唔明意義</b></td><td>Area公式嘅意義：長係有幾多行，闊係每行有幾多格。理解先唔會錯！</td></tr></table><div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「Area睇入面，Perimeter睇外圍！Square邊長乘邊長，Rectangle長乘闊最妥當。cm²記住寫平方，漏咗單位冇分攞！」</div><div class="lf-h1">七、4-Step Problem Solving</div><div class="sc"><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">1</div><div class="stitle">識別問題</div><div class="sdetail">Question問Area定Perimeter？睇單位提示：cm² = Area，cm = Perimeter</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">2</div><div class="stitle">選公式</div><div class="sdetail">Square A=邊長×邊長；Rectangle A=長×闊</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">3</div><div class="stitle">代入計算</div><div class="sdetail">帶單位一齊計，答案記得寫 cm² 或 m²</div></div><div class="sc-card"><div class="snum">4</div><div class="stitle">逆向檢驗</div><div class="sdetail">俾Area求邊長：背平方數表 1²=1,2²=4,3²=9...12²=144</div></div></div>
<!-- ═══ PARENT CORNER ═══ -->
<div style="margin:18px 0 8px;padding:14px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF7ED,#FFEDD5);border:2px solid #F59E0B;border-radius:8px;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.7;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;font-size:13px;">🏠 家長角落 · Parent Corner</strong>
<div style="margin-top:6px;color:#78350F;">
